<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">1 Korinth</book>
  <para style="h">1 Korinth</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Korinth</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Korinth</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Korinth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Pasian deilama Jesu Khrist sawltah hi dinga hat leh i unaupa uh Sosthenes in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Korinth khuo a Pasian hattuom umte, Khrist Jesu a suhsieng leh siengthou dinga hatte kungah leh gam chin a i Mangpa, (amaute leh eite Mangpa) Jesu Khrist min lou zousie kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Pa uh Pasian leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist kunga kipat hepina leh hamuonna na kung uah um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian in Khrist Jesu vanga ahepina noute ahing pieh zieh in, ka Pasian kungah kipahthu ka gen ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama Khrist vangin sil bangkim ah, thugen theina chinteng leh theina chintengah suhhausatin na um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabangin Khrist thu theipina khu noute ah suhdet ahita hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n silpieh bangma lawsapna neilou in, i Mangpa Jesu Khrist hing kilahna ding kukaltah a ngah in na um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman i Mangpa Jesu Khrist ni chienga genbaangloua na um theina ding un atawp dongin noute ahing sudet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Atapa Jesu Khrist i Mangpa toh kipawlna ah noute hing hanpa Pasian a muonhuoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Unaute aw, nouten na unpi un thu kibang na gen ua, tualeh na lah ua, kikhenna aumlouna dingin lungsim kibang leh ngaituona kibanga, hoina bukim a na kigawmkhawm theina ding un, Mangpa Jesu Khrist min in ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, Kloe innkuonpiten na lah uah kihauna aum hi, chi’n kei ahing hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami ahi ka gen: noute lah a michin in, “Kei Paul pawl ka hi,” “Kei Apollo pawl ka hi,” “Kei Kipha pawl ka hi,” tualeh “Khrist pawl ka hi,” na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khrist hawmkhen in a um amah? Paul nou a dingin kilbeh in a um amah? Ahisihleh Paul min in baptisma na tang uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khrispus leh Gaius chilou noute koima ka hing baptis khahlou ziehin Pasian kungah kipahthu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachilou in Keima min a ka baptis ahi chi aum kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi, Stephenas innkuonte zong ka baptis a, tuate loungal ka baptis lam ka thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen Khrist in baptis dingin ahing sawl sih a, khantanhoi gen dingin ahing sawl zaw hi; tuo zong mihing pilna thu a gen ahisih hi; tuachilou in Khrist kros bangmalou asuoh kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kross thu khu Mangthangte adingin mot huoi ahia, hinanleh ei hundam a umte dingin Pasian silbawltheina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen, “Mipil pilna ka suse dinga, lemguottu theisiemna bangmalou, ka suohsah ding hi,” chi a gelbangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipil hei ah a um ei? Laigielmi hei ah a um ei? Tam leitunga miselkhapa hei a um ahiei? Pasian in tam leitung pilna mot huoi asuohsah sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian pilna ah, leitungin pilna zanga Pasian atheilou nua un, thugen mot huoite zieha, agingtate hundam khu Pasian kipahna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judaten chiemtena angen ua, Greekten pilna asui uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh eite pen in Khrist kilbeth thu igen uhi, tuapen Judate a dingin kipalpuana, tualeh Greekte a dinga mot huoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Judate hiin Greekte hitaleh hatte dingin Khrist khu Pasian silbawltheina leh Pasian pilna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian motna khu mihing pilna sangin apil zaw a, tualeh Pasian hatlouna khu mihing hatna sangin ahat zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, hat na hina uh ngaituo di ua, tahsa lam a mipil tampite, mi hat tampite leh milien tampite hat ahilou dan uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in mipilte azalatsahna dingin leitung sil mothuoite a tel hi, tualeh Pasian in ahatte azalatsah na dingin leitung sil hatloute atel zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasian in leitung a sil ngiemte leh simmawhuoi silte atel a, sil um laite bangmalou asuohsah theina dingin, a umlou silte nangawn atel hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian masangah, koima akiuongsah theisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh noute pen Ama vangin Khrist Jesu ah na um uhi, Ama pen Pasian akipat eite a dinga pilna, dihtatna, suhsiengthouna, leh tatdohna hing hi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaziehin “Akisiel ut pouma Mangpa ah kisiel heh,” chia kigiel bangin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh unaute aw, noute kunga Pasian thu theipina gen a Kang pei lai in, thugen siemna leh pilna thupitah ahiei toh, hing pei ka hisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen ken noute lah ah Jesu Khrist leh killup a umpa Ama loungal bangma dang thei ka tum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei pen na lah uah hatlou leh zauin, nahpitaha chitun kawmin ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka kamsuoh leh ka thugente pen mihing pilna leh thuzawsiemna ahisih a, Hagau leh silbawltheina a sulat in ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi a na ginna uh mihing pilna a kinga hilou a, Pasian silbawltheina a akingah zawh na dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangtenghitaleh apichingte lah ah pilna thu zong ka gen zel uhi; ahivangin tu hun a leitung pilna thu ahisih a, tu hun a leitung vaihawm mangthang dingte pilna thu zong ahi tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh koute penin Pasian pilna thuguh kiphuol, ithupina dinga Pasian in leitung um masanga anamdet pilna kiphuol thu ka gen zel zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua thu pen tuhun a leitung vaihawmte koima’n athei sih uhi. Na theikha hita u’leh, thupina Mangpa akilbeh sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh, “Mit a mu ngailou, bil a zah ngai lou, Mihing lungtang a zong lut ngailou, Pasian in Ama itte dinga abawl pieh silte khu,” chi a gel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in tuate Hagauin i kungah ahing theisahta hi. Hagau in silbangkim asuidoh a, ahi, athuh mama Pasian thugilte zong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing lungsim ngaisut khu mihing sunga um hagau loungal koi ahiei thei ding? Tuamabangin Pasian Hagau loungal koima’n Pasian ngaisutte athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin Pasian in manbei a ahing pieh silte itheisiem na dingun, eiten leitung hagau itan uh ahisih a, Pasian a kipat Hagau tang ihizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua silte khu mihing pilna thuhilna thu a genlouin, Hagau Siengthou thuhilna khu genzawin, Hagau lam thute Hagau mite kungah hilchienin igen zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh leitung mi’n Pasian Hagau silte atangthei sih hi, aziehpen tuate ama ngaiin mot huoi ahi; Hagau a thei ahiziehin thei zong athei thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Hagau miin pen silbangkim atheichien zel a, ahinlah ama pen koiman atheichien sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Aziehpen ama thuhil thei dinga koi ahiei Mangpa lungsim thei ta?” Hinanleh eite penin Khrist lungsim ipuo uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute aw, Hagau mite kunga thugen bangin noute kungah ka gen thei sih hi; tahsa mite kunga gen bangin, Khrist a naungehte kunga gen bangin ka gen zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu donga anngum na neh thei nailou ziehun nawitui in Ka hing vah hi, tu nangawnin zong na ne thei nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Noute na tahsami na lai uhi. Aziehpen na lah ua, kithangsietna leh kihauna leh kipawlkhenna a um zing ziehin, tahsami hi nalai in, mihing banga um nalai hilou nahi uoi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi khat in “Kei Paul pawl” adang khat in “Kei Apollo pawl” ka hi, na chi laisie uh tahsa mi na hisih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Paul koi ahiei? Apollo zong koi ahiei? Noute pen amaute zieh a gingtute hing suohsah, Mangpa’n amaute aguot banga thunasemte chiet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ken ka suon a, Apollo in tui abuoh a, hinanleh Pasian in akhangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n akhangsahpa Pasian loungal, asuonpa bangma ahisih a, atuibuohpa zong bangma ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asuonpa leh atuibuohpa in tupna kibang anei uhi, tualeh michin in asep bang bangin kipahman asang chiet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen koute Pasian toh nasemkhawmte ka hi ua, noute pen Pasian louma na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasian hepina Kei hing kipieh dungzuiin inn lammi piltah bangin ken suongphum ka phum a, mi dangin tua suongphum tungah inn alam uhi. Ahivang in mi chinin tua suongphum tunga a inn lamdan uah pilvang chiet uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen suongphumsa loungal suongphum dang koiman aphum thei sih hi, tua suongphum khu Khrist ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam suongphum tungah mi koipouin, sanain ahiei, dangkain ahiei, suongmantamin ahiei, singin ahiei, hampain ahiei tualeh bupawlin ahiei lam taleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Michin anasep dan chiet uh ahing kilang ding hi, aziehpen aniin a phuongdoh ding hi, mei a suhlat a aum ding ahi ziehin, michin nasep bangchibang ahiei chi mei in a suchien ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi koipou nasep tua suongphum tunga lam khu a umden leh aman kipahman amu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Koipou nasep akattum leh anasep kipahman ataan ding a, hinanleh ama pen mei a pei suoh bangin hundam in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Noute Pasian biehinn na hi uhi, tualeh na sung uah Pasian Hagau ateng hi, chi theilou na hi uoimah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi koipouin Pasian biehinn asuhbua leh ama Pasian in asuse ding hi, aziehpen Pasian bieh inn khu asiengthou a, tua inn khu noute na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi koima amaleh ama kisol sih heh. Na lah ua mi koi ahiei tam leitung dan a pil akisah leh ahing pil theina dingin mi maw hing suoh phot heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen tam leitung pilna pen Pasian adingin motna ahi. “Ama’n mipilte apil lepchiena uah aman a,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tualeh Mangpa’n mipilte ngaituona khu aphatuom sih chi athei hi,” chiin akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin mi koiman mihing suong sih heh, sil zousie noute a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Paul hileh, Apollo hileh, Kipha hileh, leitung hileh, hinna hileh, shina hileh, tu hun a um silte hileh, mai lam hun a sil hing um dingte hileh, sil zousie noute a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh noute pen Khrist a na hi ua, Khrist pen Pasian a ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi’n koute pen Khrist nasemte leh Pasian thu guh kemte bangin hing ngaituo uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuathamlouin kemtu hina ah gin umna akiphamaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh noute leh mihing thukhenna in kei na hing etkhiehna uh pen kei adingin sil neunoukhat ahi. Atahtahin Keima leh keima nangawn ka ki enkhe sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ken keima kimawsahna ding bangma ka thei sih hi; hinanleh tami’n kei ahing siemtangsah tuom sih hi, hinanleh ahing enkhepa khu Mangpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa hing pei hun tun masang siein, bangma enkhe sih un, Aman miel a sil kiphuolte vah ah ahing kilangsah dinga, tualeh lungtanga ngaituonate zong ahing sulang ding hi. Tua hun chiengin michin in Pasian akipat phatna anga chiet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Unaute, akigielsa kalval a koima na ngaituo louna ding ua koute apat na zil theina ding u’leh, na lah ua koiman khat suonga midangkhat na uohkhum louna ding un, tam thute nouma vangin. Kei leh Apollo etsahna in ka kipie ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Koi ahiei noute midang apat hing tuom bawl? Tualeh na mu lou uh bang ahiei na nei uh? Na mu ua ahileh, bangdinga amulou banga kisathei na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin na dei uh na muta ua, na hauta uhi, koute tellouin leengte bangin vai na hawmta uhi; kouten zong noute toh vai ka hawm theina dingun, vaihawm ulachin ka ut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasian in kou sawltahte pen shi dinga guotsa bangin anukhiapen a hing koi hiin ka ngaituo hi, tuachi’n leitung leh vansawlsiengte mai leh mihingte mitmu a etnop a, bawl in ka umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Koute pen Khrist ziehin mi mo ka hi ua, hinanleh noute pen Khrist ah mipil na hi uhi; Koute pen ka hat sih ua, noute pen hat uhi; Noute pen zatat in na um ua, koute pen simmaw in ka um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu naikal hun nangawn in zong ka ni un, ka gilkiel un, ka dangtah ua, tualeh puonsil hoi ka nei sih ua, vuoh ka thuoh ua, inn leh lou beiin ka um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh nna ka sem ua, Kouma khuta nasemgim in ka um uhi, bawlsiet a ka um chiengun, ka guolzawl ua, ka thuoh paupau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gensiet a ka um chiengun, ka zawl lungdam ua, koute pen leitung silnieh buohna bang abawlin ka um ua, tu tandongin zong leitunga buathah kidahhuoi sil zousie banga bawl in ka um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Noute hing zumsuo dingin tam silte ka giel sih a, ka ta ittahte bangin kang phawhhil ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nouten Khrist ah hing hilmi tulsawm nei nan u’lachin zong, pa tampi na nei sih uhi; aziehpen khantanhoi ziehin Khrist Jesu ah noute kang hingkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka umdan zuimite hi dingin ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tami zieh main Mangpa a ka ta ittah leh ginum Timothi na kung uah ka hing sawl hi; aman munchina hattuomte ka hil zel bangin, Khrist a ka umdante noute ahing theidohsah kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kung ua hing peikia nawnlou ding banga hing na ngaituoin pawlkhat nana ki uongsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n pha asah leh na kung uah sawt hal louin ka hing haw pai ding hi, tuachi’n aki uongsahte khu athugen uh hilouin, asilbawltheina uh, ka theita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian gam khu thu ah aum sih a, silbawltheina ah a um zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bang ahiei na dei uh? Na kung ua chieng tawi a hing pei ding ka hiei, ahisihleh itna leh lungnemna hagau toh hing pei ding ka hiei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noute lah a kingaina thanghuoi a um hi chi, akigen thang vengvung hi, tambang kingaina Jentelte lah nangawn a um ngailou kingaina thanghuoi, mi khat in apa zi akitenpi chite ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tambang sil bawlpa khu na lah ua kipat a na nawdoh ding uh lunggimpi nahsangin, nouten na ki uohsahpi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lah uah tahsa a ka umlou vangin, hagau in ka um hi, tuabang bawlpa khu na lah ua umbangin atungah vaihawmna ka zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I Mangpa Jesu Khrist min in, ka hagau leh i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist silbawltheina toh na kikhop khawm chiengun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabang mi pen Mangpa Jesu ni chienga ahagau hundam a aum theina dingin, atahsa suhmang na ding in Setan kunga pieh ding, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na kisahtheina uh ahoi sih hi. Tol themnoukhat in tanghou beu apum in ajelsuoh chi theilou na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin tolsawlou tahtah na himabang un, tanghou beu tha na hi theina dingun, tol lui khu paikhe sieng un. Aziehpen i peikan uh Khrist khu akigou zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin pawi annkuong lui vai, tol lui tatsietna tol leh gitlouna tol toh hilouin, hinanleh gin umna leh thutah tolsawlou toh annkuong ilui zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka laihah ah, kingaina thanghuoi a kibuolte toh kigop sihun chi’n ka giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam leitung kingaina thanghuoi a buol mite, huoihamte, lepgute, ahisihleh milimbete toh, kigop vawtlou ding chi vang ka hisih hi, aziehpen tuabang ding hitaleh leitung apat na pawtdoh uh ngai ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin pen koipou sanggam kichinapi a, kingaina thanghuoi a buol, huoiham, milimbie, miphunsie, zukhamhat leh negu mi, ahi leh, ama pen kigoppi lou dingin na kung uah ka hing giel hi, tuabang mite toh neh zong nekhawm sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pulam mite ken ka ngaikhawhna ding bang a um ei? Asunga um mite hilou i nouten na vaihawmpieh leng uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh pulam a um mite pen Pasian in atung uah thu akhen ding hi. Tuaziehin “Na lah ua kipat in tua migiloupa notdoh un.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na lah ua koipou in midang khat toh thubuoi neitaleh; misiengthoute masanga tutlou in, mi dihtatloute masang ah na tut ngam ding uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Misiengthouten leitung thu khen ding ahi uh chi theilou na hi uoi mah? Tualeh leitung vaihawm ding na hi u’leh, sil neupente thukhen dinga tahlou nahi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vansawltahte vaihawm ding ihi chi na thei sih uh amah? Tuabang ahileh tam damsung silte vai ihawm sem sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuabang ahileh tam damsung silte thukhen ding na nei chiengun, hattuom ngai a aneupente thukhen dingin na guot uoi leh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na zumna dingun ka gen ahi. Na lah uah mipil khat beeh umlou ahiei mah? Khat beh a unaute kikaal a vaihawm thei ding umlou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh unau in unau na heh ua, tua zong ginglou mite masangah ahi nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin khat leh khat na kihehtuo uh pen na guollelna lienpi uh ahi. Bangdinga kimawsah zaw mailou na hi uoi? Bangding a zebawlna thuoh zou mailou na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuanah sangin nouma mama in adihlou na bawl ua, na zebawl ua, tualeh tam silte na unaute uh tungah na bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Midihtatlouten Pasian gam aluo sih ding uh, chi theilou na hi uoi mah? Sol in um sih un. Kingaina thanghuoi a buolte, milimbete, angkawmte, pasal kizuate, tokohuate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gutate, huoihamte, zukhamhatte, migensiethatte leh neguten, Pasian gam aluo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na lah ua pawlkhat tambang mi na hi ngaita uhi. Hinanleh Mangpa Jesu Khrist min leh i Pasian uh Hagau a sawpsieng na hita ua, suhsiengthou na hita ua, siemtansah na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kei dingin sil zousie bawl a sienga,” hinanleh sil zousie bawl ahoi kim sih hi; “Kei ding in sil zousie bawl asienga,” hinanleh bangma silbawltheina nuoi ah ka um sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ann pen gilpi a ding ahia, gilpi zong ann a ding ahi,” hinanleh aniin Pasian in asumang ding hi. Tualeh tahsa khu kingaina thanghuoi a ding ahisih a, Mangpa a ding ahi zaw hi, tualeh Mangpa zong tahsa a ding ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasian in Mangpa akaithou a, tualeh eite zong a silbawltheina in ahing kaithou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na sapumpi uh Khrist hiengte ahi chi theilou na hi uoi mah? Ken Khrist hiengte lain kizuate hiengin ka bawl ding adiei mah? bawl vawt lou ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahisihleh, kizuami toh kizop mi pouma amanu toh pumkhat ahi uh chi theilou na hi uh amah? “Aman ani un, pumkhat ahita dinguh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa toh kizop mi pen Ama toh Hagau a pumkhat ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ki ngaina thanghuoi taisan un, mihing khelna zousie pen tahsa pulam ahi, hinanleh kingaina thanghuoi bawl miin ama tahsa tungah sil abawlkhiel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahisihleh, na tahsa pumpi uh pen na sung ua um, Pasian akipat a na mu uh Hagau Siengthou inn ahi a, nouma a na hisih uh, chi theilouna hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Azieh pen man a leisa na hi ta uhi; tuaziehin na tahsapum u’leh na hagau un Pasian pahtawi un tuate Pasian a ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin ka kunga nang laihah uh tungtang thu ah; pasal a dingin numei suhkhahlou ahoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahivang in kingaina thanghuoi a umlouna dingin pasal chin in ama zi chiet nei henlen, numei in zong ama pasal chiet nei heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasal in nupa hina a azi tan dinga kilawm azi kung ah pie henlen, tuamabangin azi in zong apasal tan dinga kilawm apasal kungah pie heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zi in ama tahsa tungah thu anei sih a, apasal in anei zaw hi, tuamabangin pasal in ama tahsa tung ah thu anei sih a, azi in anei zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ann ngawlna leh thungetna a na kipumpieh theina ding ua hun khat pha na sahtuoh uh ahiloungal leh koima kidehtuo sih un, na kideh zoulou zieh ua Setan in ang sol louna dingin hing umkhawm zel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh tam thu pen thupieh banga ka gen hilouin phalna thu dan a ka gen ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi zousie keima bang chiet u’leh ka dei hi. Hinanleh michin in Pasian apat silpieh tuom chiet inei uhi. Mi khat in silpieh khat, midangin silpieh tuom khat anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin zi leh pasal nei nailoute leh meithaite kungah ka gen ahi, Keima bangin um u’leh ama ua ding in ahoi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh akideh zou sih u’leh, kiteng u’heh, aziehpen hua sangin kiten ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuin kitengsate kungah thu ka pie hi, kei pieh hilou in Mangpa pieh ahi zaw, ziin apasal taisan sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ataisan hiel tahleh pasal neilou in umden heh, ahisihleh apasal toh kilem kia u’heh. Tualeh pasal in azi akhul lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh midangte kungah, Mangpa gen hilou in Keima’n ka gen ahi; unaupa khat in gingloumi zi a anei a, amanu akunga a umden nuom leh khul sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh numei in ginglou mi pasal a anei leh apasal akunga a umden nuom leh nuasie sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen ginglou pasal pen azi ziehin suhsiengthouin aum hi, tuabang hisihleh na tate uh asieng sih ding hi, hinanleh tuin vang asiengthou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh aginglou zaw penin akhen leh khen mai heh. Tambang thu ah unaupa ahiei, unaunu ahiei, kaan in a um sih hi. Hinanleh Pasian in eite kilemtah a um dingin ang han hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen zi aw na pasal na hundam ding leh dinglou bang na thei ei? ahisihleh pasal in na zi na hundam ding leh dinglou bang na thei ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in michin kunga ahawmpieh tah bangin, Mangpa’n michin ahat tah bangin, tuabangin um u’heh. Tuabangin kenzong hattuom chin ah ka namdet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hat a aum laitah a teptansa mi a um ei? teptanlou hing hi tuom sih heh. Teptan lou hat mi aum ei? Teptan tuom sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasian thupieh zui chiloungal teptan bangma ahisih a, Teptanlou zong bangma ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Michin hat a aum bangun um chiet uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Suoh na hilai a hat na hiei? Khawhsa sin, hinanleh suotatsah thei ding na hileh, tuakhu zangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Suoh ahilai a Mangpa hat mi pen, Mangpa ah mi noplen ahi. Tuamabangin noplen ahilai a hat zong Khrist suoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Man a leisa na hi ua, mihing suoh hisih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Unaute aw, michin hat a aum na bang chiet in, Pasian toh um chiet heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin nungah siengthoute tungtang ah, Mangpa akipat thupieh ka nei sih hi, hinanleh Pasian in khotuona apieh muonhuoi a abawl mi bangin ka ngaidan ka gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin tulai hasatna ziehin pasal a umdan ngai banga aum ahoi dingin ka ngaisut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zi a kaan na hiei mah? Kisutkhiet tum sin, zi apat kisutkhie na hiei? Zi sui sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh zi nei na hileh na khiel sih a, nungah siengthou in pasal anei leh akhiel sih hi. Ahivang in tambang miten tahsa a buoina a tuoh ding uhi, hinanleh ken hing awngsut ut ka hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh unaute tam thu ka gen ahi, hun atomta hi, tuachi’n zi neite nangawn zi neilou bangin um henlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kapte kaplou bangin, kipahte kipahlou bangin van leiten, neilou bangin, um henlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh, tam leitung zangte khu zangvallou bangin um heh. Tam leitung umdan pen abeimang ngitnget ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ken noute lunghimawna neilou a na um uh Kang dei hi zi neilou pasal in Mangpa akipahsah theina dingin, Mangpa lam silte a awlmaw leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh zi neisa pasal in pen, azi akipahsah theina dingin, leitung silte a awlmaw zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pasal neisa numei leh nungah siengthou zong akibang sih hi. Pasal neilou numeiin, tahsa leh hagau a asienthou theina dingin, Mangpa lam silte a awlmaw hi. Hinanleh pasal neisa numei in pen apasal akipahsah theina dingin leitung silte a awlmaw zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tam thute na phattuompi ding ua ka gen ahi. Na tung ua thukham bawl ka hisih a, hinanleh umdan kilawm a na um theina ding u’leh, Mangpa nna buoilou a nasep theina ding ua ka gen ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hinanleh mi koipou in ata nungah siengthou akul donga alensah a atunga dihlou akisah a, apasal nei ding hoi asah leh, hoi asah bangbang in bawl heh, akhiel sih hi, pasal neisah mai heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahivang in mi koipou lungsim dettah nei a, apoimawna neilou a, ama lungsim kithunun zou a, ata nungah siengthou kem dinga alungtang a, tupna nei mi in abawl hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n ata nungah pasal neisahpan abawl hoi hi, hinanleh pasal neisahloupa’n abawl hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Zi pen apasal dam sungsie dan a kaan ahi, hinanleh apasal ashi leh Mangpa aum mi, a dei khat poupou akitenpi thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanleh kei ngaituo dan in, amanu aum ngai bangin pasal neilou in um leh nuom asa zaw ding hi; tualeh Kei zong Pasian Hagau nei in ka kingai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin milimte biehna sillatte tungtang pen “I unpi un theina inei chiet uh” chi ithei uhi. “Theina” in mi akisathei sah a, hinanleh itna in mi abawl hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi koipou in bang ahiei khat thei a akingaisut leh athei ding bang thei nailou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh mi koipou in Pasian a it leh tua mipa khu Pasian thei in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin milim biehna kithoina sillatte neh lam thu ah, “Leitungah milim kichi bangma ahisih a,” tualeh “Pasian khat loungal adang a um sih,” chi ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Van ah hiin leitungah hitaleh pasien kichite um nan u’leh (tuabang “pasien” tampi leh “mangpa” tampi a um uhi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh eite adingin Pasian khat bou a um a, Ama pen sil zousie hing kipatna Pa ahi. Eite Ama a um ihi ua, Mangpa khat Jesu Khrist a um hi, Ama ziehin sil zousie ahing um a, eite zong Ama zieh a um ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangtenghileh, theina khu mi zousie ah aum kim sih a, kimkhat in tu tanin milimte angaisang mama ua, milimte kunga kithoina sillatte ane ua, asie leh pha theina uh ahatlou zieh in akibua sah zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh ann neh in Pasian pahtat ahing lawsah sih a, ineh ziehun i hoizaw uh ahi sih a, inehlou zieh un zong ise zaw tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh pilvang un, tuachilouin pen na noplenna uh bangchi ahiei in, mi hatloute adingin puana ahing hikha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen theina nei nang, mi koi ahiei in, milim biehna inn a ann ne dinga na tou lai hing mu taleh, ama sie leh pha theina hatlou khu milim biehna kithoina sillatte ne dingin maingalsah khalou ding na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n na theina ziehin unau hatlou ama shi taanga Khrist shina khu, amangthang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh tambanga na unaute uh tunga na khel ua; asie leh pha theina hatlou uh na liemsah khah chiengun, Khrist tunga khiel na suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin, ka ann neh in ka unau akipalpuasah leh ka unau ka pua sah louna dingin bangchih tan in sa mawngmawng ka ne nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sawltah hilou ka hiei mah? Noplen hilou ka hiei mah? Ken i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist ka mu sih amah? Noute Mangpa a ka nasepga hilou na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Midangte a dingin sawltah hisih nanleng, noute a dingin vang ka hi thamtham hi. Mangpa a sawltah ka hina chiemtena noute na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei hing enkhete kunga ka dawnna khu tami ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Koute neh ding leh dawn ding tungtang thuneina neilou ka hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawltah dangte leh Mangpa unaute leh kipha banga gingta mi zi khat zawpi kawikawi theilou ka hi tuom uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahisihleh Barnaba leh kei guoh ka nasepna ua pat ki awngsut theilou ka hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Galkap koi ahiei ama neisa senga galkap a kuon ngai? Grep huon bawl a, aga ne lou koi a um ei? Ahisihleh koi ahiei ganhon khawi ngal a anawi ne lou?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihing ngaisut dan a tam thute gen ka hiei mah? Dan thuin zong tambangma hilou amah agen?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen Mosi dan laibu ah “Bawngtal in bu achil lai in amuh kaan sin,” chi’n akigiel hi. Pasian in bawngtalte bou ahiei a awlmaw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahisihleh Aman eite a ding zieh mama a agen hilou ahiei mah? Hitham e, tami eite adinga kigiel ahi; loukai miin kinem tahin akai dinga, tualeh kinem taha bu vawmi in zong akinepna amu ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kouten noute kunga hagau lam haichi ka tu u’leh, na tahsa lam silte uh at ta u’leng sil thupi ahi diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midangten na tung ua tam thuneina anei u’leh kouten neizawsem louding ka hi uoi mah? Ahivang in tam thuneina ka zang sih uhi, hinanleh Khrist khantanhoi ka dal louna dingun sil bangkim ka thuoh zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sil siengthou a biehna nasemten, biehinn a silte ane ua, tualeh maitam a nasemten maitam a silte ah tan anei uh chi na thei sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuabangmain khantanhoi gen mite pen, khantanhoi ma a ahin ding uh chi’n Mangpa’n thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh ken tam silte khatbeh ka zang sih hi, tualeh tam silte ka tungah kibawl leh chia giel zong ka hisih hi, mi koi ahiei in ka kisahtheinapen bangmalou asuo sangin kei dingin shi ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khantanhoi gen nanleng kisahtheipi ding bangma ka nei sih hi; genlou theilou ka tunga kinga ahi ziehin, khantanhoi gen sih leng ka tung gih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen tam sil keima ut thu a bawl hileng, kipahman mu ding ka nei hi, hinanleh ka ut thu lou a bawl ka hileh, kepna nna kei hing kingansie ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuahileh ka kipahman bang ahi diei? Khantanhoi ka gen chienga, khantanhoi a ka thuneina zangkhiel lou a, Khrist khantanhoi amanbei a ka pieh khu ka kipahman ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi zousie akipat noplen hinapi in, mi tamsem ka lahlut theina dingin mi zousie suohin ka kibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judate ka lahlut theina dingin, Judate lah ah Judami bangin ka um a, dan nuoi a umte ka lahlut theina dingin, dan nuoi a umte lah ah dan nuoi a um bangin ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dan neiloute ka lahlut theina dingin, dan neiloute lah ah dan neiloute bangin ka um hi. Pasian lam ah pen dan neilou ka hisih a, Khrist dan nuoi a um ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahatloute ka lahlut theina dingin mi hatloute lah ah ahatlou bangin ka um hi, bangchi ahiei a, mi bangza ahiei beeh ka hundam theina dingin, mi zousie lah ah, sil bangkim ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Noute toh khantanhoi guolzawlna ka tan theina dingin, khantanhoi ziehin tami ka bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kitaidemna ah kidemte zousie atai ua, hinanleh mi khat maimai in kipahman amu hi, chi na thei sih uh amah? Tua kipahman namu theina dingun tai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi koipou kipahman sang dinga kidemna a pang mite sil zousie ah ama leh ama akithunun uhi. Amauten guolzawna lukhu sethei sang ding in apang ua, eite pen in asetheilou guolzawna lukhu sang dingin ipang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin kei pen tupna neilou a tai ka hisih a, mi toh ka kisuh chiengin aguohtangpi su ka hisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh ka tahsa ka thunun a, ka thuzawna nuoi ah ka koi hi tuachilou in pen midangte kunga khantanhoi ka gen nuain keima nasan chingzoulou in ka umkha ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuathamlouin unaute aw, tam thu nathei lou uh ka dei sih hi; ipu ipate a unpi un meipi nuoi ah ana um ua, tualeh a unpi un tuipi kaan in apeisuoh uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a unpi un meipi lah ah leh tuipi sungah Mosi kungah baptis in aum ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tualeh a unpi un hagau lam ann kibang ane ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a unpi un hagau lam dawn kibang adawn chiet ua, amaute zuitu hagau lam suongpi akipat adawn chiet uhi, tua suongpi khu Khrist ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh alah ua mi tampite tungah Pasian alungkimta sih a, gamdai ah apualum gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam silte eite adinga i etton ding uh ahi, amaun silgilou alunggul bang ua, eiten ilunggul louna dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Alah ua kimkhatte milim bemi ahi bangun, milim bemi hisih un; “Mipite ne ding leh dawn dingin atousuh ua, tualeh nuomtal a laam dingin ading doh uh,” chi a kigiel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Alah ua pawlkhat numei pasal kaal ah a thangtat ua, ni khat in tulsawmni leh thum a shi bang un eite thangtat sih vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh alah ua pawlkhat in Mangpa a ze et ua gul a suhmanga aum bangun eiten vang Khrist i ze et sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A lah ua pawlkhat aphun ua, sumangtu suhmang a aum bangun, eite phun sih vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tamte zousie pen etton dingin atung uah ana tung hi, tualeh eite leitung huntawp hing tunnate kunga thuhilna dinga kigiel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin dinga kingaituo mi pilvang heh, tuachilou in pen apua kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing thuohzoulou solna na tung uah atung ngai nai sih, hinanleh Pasian amuonhuoi hi, Aman na thuoh zoulou uh solna na tuoh ding uh aphal sih ding hi; na thuohzouna ding un solna apat suotatna lampi ahing bawlpieh zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka ittahte aw, milim biehna taisan un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mipilte thugen bangin ka gen ahi, ka thugen ngaituo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Guolzawlna nou iguolzawl u’khu Khrist sisan itankhawmna uh hilou ahiei mah? Tanghou ibalkeh u’khu Khrist tahsa itankhawmna uh hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen eite tampi hinapi in tanghou khat tualeh sapum khat ihi uhi, aziehpen tua tanghou pheng khat ah tan inei chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tahsa dan a Israelte en un, kithoina sa nete, maitam toh tan neikhawmte ahisih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahileh bang ahiei ka gen? Milim khu sil bang ahiei khat ahia, ahisihleh milim biehna sil kilante khu sil bang ahiei khat ahi ka china ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jentelten kithoina sil alatte uh Pasian kunga lat hilou in dawite kunga lat ahi, ka china ahi, tualeh noute dawite toh na kipawlkhawm uh ka dei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mangpa nou leh dawite nou na dawnkhawm thei sih ding uh, Mangpa annkuong leh setan annkuong zong na nekhawm thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahisihleh Mangpa thangsietna a lungthahsah ding ihi uh amah? Ama sanga hatzaw ihi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Sil zousie kei a dingin asienga,” hinanleh sil zousie aphatuom kim sih hi, “Kei a dingin sil zousie asienga,” hinanleh silzousie in abawl hoi tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi koiman ama hoina ding ngen sui sih henlen, midangte hoina ding sui chiet zaw heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sa kizuana mun a, kizua sate, na sie leh pha theina uh dong sese louin ne un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aziehpen “Leitung leh asunga um zousie Mangpa a ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ginglou mite lah a koi ahiei khat in, ann ne ding a ahing chiel a, haw ding na lunggul u’leh, na masang ua kilui pouma na sie leh pha theina zieh uh dong sese lou in ne un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh mi koi ahiei khat in, “Tam pen milim kunga kithoina sa ahi” chi a ahing hil leh, ahing hilpa zieh leh sie leh pha theina ziehin ne sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangma sie leh pha theina ka gen ahisih a, midang sie leh pha theina gen ka hi zaw hi. Aziehpen midang sie leh pha theinain bang dinga ka noplenna hing awimaw ding ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh Ken lungdamna toh ka neh leh, bangdinga kipahthu ka gen zieh a gensiet a um ka hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaziehin na neh un hileh na dawn un hileh, na bawl pouma uh Pasian thupina dingin bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Judate ahiei, Greekte ahiei, ahisihleh Pasian hattuomte hitaleh apuana dingun bangma bawl sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ken sil bangkim ka bawlna ah, mi zousie lungkim sah ding ka tup bangin, keima phattuomna ding guoh suilou in, hundam ahi theina dingun, mi tampite phattuomna ding ka sui zaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei Khrist umdan lapa ka hi bangin, noute ka umdan late hi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Unaute aw sil bangkim a kei na hing thei ngitnget zieh u’leh, thugousie ka hing hilte na kep ngitnget zieh un noute ka hing pahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh pasal pouma lutang Khrist ahia, numei lutang pasal ahi, tualeh Khrist lutang Pasian ahi chi, nouten na thei uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lutang khu puma pasal thungen ahiei, ahisihleh, thugen ahieiin alutang azatat lou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh numei in alutang khulou a, thungen ahiei ahisihleh thugen ahiei pouma in, alutang azatat lou ahi, aziehpen tuabanga bawlmi pen asam heukieu toh kibang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Numei in alutang akhu sih leh, asam heukieu heh; hinanleh numei a dinga sam heu ahiei, ahisihleh heukieu ahiei azumhuoi leh alutang khu heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasal in pen alutang akhu lou ding mawng ahi, ama pen Pasian lim leh mel pua leh thupina ahi; numei ahileh pen pasal thupina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen pasal khu numei apat a siem ahisih a, numei pen pasal apat a siem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasal pen numei a dinga siem ahisih a, numeipen pasal a dinga siem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tamte ziehin numei in pasal thuneina chiemtena vansawlsiengte ziehin, alutang akhu ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahivang in Mangpa ah pasal lou in numei atangin a um thei sih a, pasal numei lou in atangin a um thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen numei pen pasal apat siem ahimabangin pasal zong numei akipat a pieng ahi, hinanleh sil zousie Pasian a kipata hing pieng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nouma leh nouma ki ngaituo un, numei in alutang khu loua, Pasian kunga thungetna anei akilawm ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasal in asam akhawisau leh ama a dingin azumhuoi ahi chi ngaina dan in zong ahing hil sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh numei in asam akhawisau leh ama a dingin thupina ahizaw hi, aziehpen asam khu alutang khuna dinga pieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh mi koi ahiei in aniel ut leh, tambang tawndan inei sih ua, Pasian hattuomten zong anei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu a tam thute ka hing hilna ah noute ka hing phat thei sih hi; noute na kikhop chieng un hoizohna ding hilouin sietzoh semna dingin na kikhawm zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amasapen in hattuoma na kikhop chiengun, na lah uah kilangkhenna aum hi chi ka za a, tualeh gin zong ka gingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen atahtah a kipomte akilat theina ding un, na lah uah kilangkhenna a um ding mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin mun khat a nang kikhop chieng ua, na neh u’pen Mangpa nitah ann ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen na neh chiengun, michin in, midangte neh masangin nouma nitah ann na kineh chiet ua, tuachi’n khat agilkiel a, midangin zu akham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangchidan ahiei, nouten nehna ding leh dawnna ding inn neilou na hi uoi mah? Ahisihleh Pasian hattuom na simmaw un bangma neiloute na selphou uh ahiei mah? Na kung ua bang ahiei ka gen ding? Tam thu ah noute ka hing pahta ding amah? Kang pahta vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa a kipat a ka mu khu noute ka hing hilsawn ahi, tuachia Mangpa Jesu matsah a aum zanin tanghou ala-a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />kipahthu agen zouin aphalsuo a, la unlen ne un, “Tami noute a dinga kiphalsuo ka tahsa ahi, na hing thei ngitnget na dingun bawl zel un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachimabangin nitah ann a neh zouin, nou zong ala a, “Tam nou ka sisan a thuhun tha ahi, na dawn teng ua na hing thei ngitnget na dingun, tami bawl zel un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aziehpen tam tanghou na neh ua, tam nou nadawn tengun, ahing peikia masangsie Mangpa shina na phuongzah uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin mi koipouin chingloupi a, Mangpa tanghou ne leh nou dawn khu, Mangpa tahsa leh sisan tungah siemmaw atang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi ama leh ama ki en chien zaw heh, tuachi’n tanghou khu ne henlen nou khu dawn heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Koipouin Mangpa tahsa ngaituo lou a, ne tahlou leh dawn tahloupi a, aneh a adawn leh ama leh ama siemmaw kitanna dingin ane in adawn ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tami ziehin na lah ua mi tampi na zawngkhal ua na china uhi, tualeh tampi na imuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ei ma leh eima’n thukhen in ki en chien masa lei, thukhen pieh a umlou ding ihi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanleh thukhenpieh a i um in zong, leitung mite toh siemmawtanga i umlouna dingin Mangpa vauhil in i um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaziehin unaute aw, ne dinga na hing kikhop chiengun khat leh khat kingah chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh na kikhopna uh siemmawtan a aumlouna dingin, mi koipou agil akiel leh a inn lamah ne heh, thudangte pen ka hing pei chiengin kang hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute aw, tuin Hagau lam silpiehte tungtang theiloua na um ding uh ka dei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Noute Jentelte na hi lai un, puia na um bang zel ua, a ham theilou milimte lam a puimangin na um uh, chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin noute ka hing theisah ahi, Pasian Hagau a thugen koima’n “Jesu hamse thuoh ahi” achi ngai sih hi, tualeh Hagau Siengthou louin koima’n Jesu khu “Mangpa” ahi achi thei ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuin silpieh tuom tuom a um a, hinanleh Hagau khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh nasep tuomtuom a um a, hinanleh Mangpa khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nasepdan tuom tuom a um a, hinanleh bangkim a bangkim nasempa kibang Pasian khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh phattuom chietna dingin michin kungah Hagau nasep kilahna pieh chiet a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi khat kungah Hagau a pilna thu pieh ahi a, midang kungah tua Hagau main theina thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua Hagau main midang kungah ginna apie a, midang kungah tua Hagau main suhdam theina silpieh apieh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Midang kungah sillamdang bawltheina pieh ahia, midang kungah thugen theina pieh ahi; midang kungah Hagaute theikhen theina pieh ahi a, midang kungah ham tuomtuom a thugentheina pieh ahi, midang kungah ham tuomtuomte ledohtheina pieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh tuate zousie khu Hagau khat main, Ama deina bangin mimal chinteng kungah hawmin asem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen tahsa pumpi khat ahia, hieng tampi anei hi, hieng zousiete tam nan u’leh sapum khat ahi uhi, tuamabangin, Khrist zong tuabang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eite i unpiun Hagau khat in tahsapum khat ah ahing baptis lut hi; Juda mite hiin, Greek mite hitaleh, suoh hiin, noplen hitaleh, a unpi un Hagau khat ma a dawnsah in iumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tahsapum pen hieng khat guoh ahi sih a, hieng tampi ahizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Keng in kei khut ka hilou ziehin tahsa ah ka pang sih chitaleh,” tua achi ziehin tahsa panglou ahi diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh bil in “Mit ka hilou ziehin tahsa a pang ka hi sih chitaleh,” tua achi ziehin tahsa a panglou ahi diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tahsa pumpi khu mit hisiengta leh khozahna hei ah aumta diei? Apumpi in khozahna hi sieng taleh, gimnam theina hei ah a um ta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in ahieng chinteng tahsa tunga adeina mun mun ah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh a unpi un hieng khat hita mawh u’leh tahsa hei ah a umta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin pen hieng tampi hinan u’leh tahsapum khat asuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mit in khut kungah, “Nang kang poimaw sih” achi thei sih a, lutangin zong keng kung ah “Nang kang tulmaw sih” achi thei tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi nahsangin ahatlou zaw a kilang tahsa hiengte apoimaw penpente ahi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tahsa hieng ngaisah thamlou a ingaisutte zatatna thupizaw i piehte ahi zaw uhi, tualeh itahsa hieng bangmathamlou a i ngaiten nahpitah in kilawmna anei zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I hieng kilawmten tuabang akiphamaw sih uhi. Hinanleh Pasian in apoimaw thamlou hiengte khu zatatna lien zaw piein tahsapumpi alemkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachia tahsa kikhenna a umlouna dingin, hiengte khat leh khat kibanga aki-awlmawtuo chiet theina ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tahsa hieng khat in athuoh leh hieng zousiein athuohkhawm zel ua, tualeh hieng khat pahtat a a um leh hieng zousie ama toh akipahkhawm chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuin noute Khrist tahsa na hi ua, amimal mal in ahiengte na hi chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian in kimkhatte hattuom ah ahing koi a, amasapen in sawltahte, anina ah guolneite, athumna ah thuhilmite, tuaban ah sillamdang bawl mite, tuazou chiengin suhdam na silpieh neite, midang panpi theinate, vaihawm siemnate, ham tuom tuom a hamtheinate aguot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aunpi un sawltahte ahi uoi? A unpi un guolnei ahi uoi? Aunpi un thuhil mite ahi uoi? Aunpi un sil lamdang bawlmite a hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A unpi un suhdam theina silpiehte nei ahi uoi? A unpi un ham theilou in thu agen uoi? Aunpi un ham theilou alet thei uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh silpieh hoi pente lunggul zaw un, tuachi’n lampi hoizaw ka hing musah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing hamte leh vansawlsieng hamte in thu gen nanleeng itna ka nei sih leh dah ging ahisih leh dahkhubeh ging ahiei bang ka hi giap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thumavang gentheina silpieh nei in, thuguh kiphuolte zousie leh theina zousie thei sieng nan leng, tualeh muol leh taangte kisuontheina khop ginna nei nanleng, itna ka nei sih leh bangma ka hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh ka nei zousie mi gentheite vana dingin pe siengin, tualeh ka tahsa haltum dingin pengam nanleng zong, itna ka nei sihleh bangma aphatuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Itna in athuoh zou a, anunnem hi, Itna in athangse sih a, itna akisiel sih a, aki uongsah sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Agumtat sih a, ahuoiham sih a, alungthah bai sih a, silgilou angaituo ngai sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dihtatlounate akipahpi sih a, hinanleh thutah akipahpi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Itna in sil zousie athuohsiem a, silzousie agingta a, sil zousie ah akinema, sil zousie athuoh muolsuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Itna abei ngai sih ding hi. Hinanleh thumavang gente um nanleh abei ding hi; ham theiloute ahing tawp ding a, theinate um nanleh ahing mang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eiten akim lou a ithei zieh un, akimlou in igen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh abukimna ahing tun chiengin akimlou khu suhbei ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka naupan lai in, naupang ham in ka ham a, naupang thei in ka thei a, naupang ngaituoin ka ngaituo hi. Hinanleh ka hing pichin bepin naupanlai silte ka paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen tuin himlanga et bangin, chienglou milmiel in imu ua, hinanleh tua hun chiengin vang kimaituo in imuta ding uhi, tuin pen akimlou in ka thei a, hinanleh tua hun chiengin vang kei hing kithei bangin ka theita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua leh tuin, ginna, kinepna leh itna, tamteng thum a umden hi, hinanleh tamteng lah a alien pen itna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Itna del unlen, tualeh Hagau silpiehte adiehin thumavang gen theina lunggul un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ham theilou a ham miin mihingte kunga thugen ahisih a, Pasian kunga thugen ahi zaw hi. Koima’n ama atheisiem sih hi, hinanleh Hagau in thuguh kiphuolte agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thumavang gen miin pen mihingte kungah, siemphatna ding, hanthawnna ding leh hamuonnading thute agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ham theilou a thugen mi, ama leh ama akisiemhoi a, hinanleh thumavang gen miin, hattuom asiemhoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na unpi ua ham theiloua na ham uh kang deisah a, hinanleh thumavang na gen thei uh ka hing deisah sem hi; hattuom siemhoina dinga ledoh ahi sih leh, ham theiloua ham sangin thumavang gen mi ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin unaute ham theilou a thugen in na kung uah hing peita leng, kilahnain ahiei, theinain ahiei, thumavang gentheinain ahiei, ahisihleh, thuhilnain ahiei, na kung uah, gen sih leng noute bangin ka hing phatuom sah diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinna neilou sil gingtheite theile ahiei, ahisihleh kaiging ahiei zong umzie nei a agin sih leh bang kimut a, bang kitum ahiei chi, bang achi kithei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pengkul pen mumal bei in kimut gingta leh koi ahiei gal kuon dinga kisa ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuamabangin noutenzong ham kithei bailam zanga thu na gen sih u’leh, bang kigen ahiei chi bang achi kithei diei? hui lah a ham bang giap na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leitungah ham chi tuom tuom tampi a um hi, hinanleh gen neilou ham a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin ham a thu kigen bang genna ahiei chi ka thei sih leh tua thugenpa adingin kei hammahpa ka hi dinga, ama zong kei a ding in gamtuom mi hammahpa ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuabangmain hagau lam silpiehte na lunggul bangun, hattuom bawlhoina dinga, na hing khantou theina ding uh sui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin ham theiloua thugen miin aledoh theina dingin thungen heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ham theiloua thu ka nget leh ka hagau in zong thu angen a, hinanleh ka theina khu agasuo tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahileh bang ka law ta diei leh? Hagau in thu ka ngen dinga, lungsim a theina in zong thu ka ngen ding hi. Hagau in la kasa dinga tualeh lungsim atheinain zong kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachilouin Hagau a guolzawlna na gen chiengin bangma theilou miin, na kipahthu gen ah bangchi’n “Amen,” achithei diei? aman na thugen athei loupi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangman kipahthu na hoi gen ngel a, hinanleh midang a bawlhoi tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Noute zousie sanga ham theilou a thu kagen tam zawh ziehin ka Pasian kungah kipahthu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahivang in hattuom sunga ham theiloua thu tul sawm ka gen sangin, ka thugen a midangte ka hil theina dingin ka theisiemna toh thu teng nga ka gen zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Unaute aw, na ngaituona uah naupang sih unlen, gitlouna lam ah naungeh un, theisiemna lam ah piching un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dan laibu sungah: “Ham dang mite leh, gamdang mite ham in, tam mite kungah thu ka gen dinga, hinanleh ka thugen angaikhe, tuom sih ding uhi; Mangpa’n chi hi.” Chiin akigel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin ham theilou khu, gingtute a ding hilou in, agingtalou mite a ding a chiemtena ahi, hinanleh thumavang gen pen agingta lou mite a ding hilou in, agingta mite a ding ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin hattuom pumpi mun khat a na kikhopna uah, mi zousie ham theilouin hamta u’lachin, tualeh tua mun ah athei nailou leh ginglou mi hing tel taleh noute mi maw ahing chi sih ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh mi zousie’n thumavang gen chietta u’lachin tuanah ginglou mi ahiei ahisihleh atheilou mi khat hing pei leh agitloudan na unpi ua theisah in aumta dinga na unpi ua awimaw ahing hita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n alungtang thuguhte suhlat in a um ding a, tuachi’n khupboh a puain Pasian abe dinga, na lah uah Pasian a um tahtah na hi chiin aphuong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Unaute aw, bangchi ahita diei le? Noute na hing kikhop chiengun, michin in phatna la bang, thukihilna bang, ham theilou bang, kilahna bang, ham theiloute ledohna bang, na nei chiet uhi. Sil zousie bawlhoina dinga bawl hi heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi koipou in ham theiloua thu agen leh mi ni ahiei, ahisihleh atam pen in thum in gen heh, tua zong khat khat in kiha zel u’henlen, khat in letdoh heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Alet ding mi a um sih leh hattuom kikhopna ah ham louin sip khinkhien heh, alungsim in ama leh Pasian kungah kigen heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thumavang gente ni ahiei thum ahiei in gen henlen, midangten thu kigente ngaituo chien uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh akunga tou midang khat kunga kilahna ahing tun leh thugen masa pen sip heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi zousie in athei a, kihanthawn a aum theina ding un, na unpi un khat khat a kiha in thu na gen thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh thumavang gente Hagau khu thumavang gente thuthu in aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pasian pen buoina Pasian ahi sih a, lemna Pasian ahi zaw hi. Misiengthoute hattuom zousie a ahi bangin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na numeite uh hattuom sungte ah sip dide in um uheh, ama ua dingin thugen phal ahi sih hi, danin zong agen bangin, thunuoiluta a um zoh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amauten bang ahiei thei nuom anei u’leh inn lam ah apasalte uh dong uheh, hattuom sunga thugen numei a dingin azum huoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pasian thu noute apat hing kipan ahiei mah? Ahisihleh noute maimai hing banpha ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mi koipouin guolnei ahiei, ahisihleh Hagau silpieh nei a hagaumi a akingaituo leh na kung ua kang gelte Mangpa thupieh ahi chi thei u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hinanleh mi koi zong atheilou a um leh, atheilou in um mai heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaziehin unaute aw, thumavang gen lunggul unlen, ham theilou a ham zong khaam sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sil zousie hoitah leh kitup tah a bawl hi heh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin unaute aw, na kung ua ka khantanhoi gen khu na pomta ua, tuama ah na dingkip uhi, chi ka hing theisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na kung ua ka thugen na pomdet u’leh tuami mama ah hundam zong na hi uhi, tuachi ahisihleh pen amawhna a gingta na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amasapen in ken zong ka mu khu noute kungah ka hing hil sawn ahi; tua pen Laisiengthou gen bangin Khrist khu ikhelnate ziehin ashi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vui in a um a, Laisiengthou gen bangin nithum niin athoukiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kipha kungah akilah a, tuazouin sawm le nite kungah akilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuami nuain sanggam za nga sanga tamzawte kungah khatvei thuin akilah a, alah ua atamzawte tutan in adam na lai ua, hinanleh kimkhattepen a imuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuami nuain Jakob kungah akilah a, tua zouin sawltah zousiete kungah akilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh atawpna pen ah ahunlou a pieng kei kungah zong akilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen sawltahte lah a aneupen ka hi a, Pasian hattuomte ka bawl genthei ziehin sawltah chitaah zong ka hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian hepina ziehin ka hina bangbang ka hi hi ding ka hita, tualeh A hepina hing pieh khu athawn in a um sih hi. Hinanleh amaute zousie sangin ka sem gim zaw hi, hinanleh kei sep ahi sih a, Pasian hepina ka kunga um in asep ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin kei hiin amaute hitaleh khantanhoi ka gen ua, tuachi’n nouten na gingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin mishite lah a kipat Khrist kaithawin a umta chi akigen ngal leh, bangchi dana na lah ua mi pawl khat in mishi thawkiana aum sih na chi uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mishite thawkiana ana umlou hitaleh, Khrist zong kaithawin a um sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khrist thoukia lou na hitaleh pen ka thugen uh amawhna ahi dinga, na ginna uh zong amawhna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi, Pasian in Khrist akaithou hi chia, Pasian theipi mi hi a thu ka gen ziehun, koute Pasian theipi mi dihlou bangin ka kilangta uhi; mishite thoukialou ana hitaleh Pasian in Khrist zong akaithou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen mishite thoukia lou hileh Khrist zong kaithouin aum sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Khrist kaithoua na umlou hitaleh, na ginna uh amawhna ahi dinga, na khelna uah na um nalai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Khrist a na imusate amangthang ahita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eiten tu damsunga dinga Khrist kineppi giap ihi u’leh mi zousie lah a mi hepi huoipen ihi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin Khrist khu mishi lah a kipat kaithaw in a umta a, ana imu masate laha ga masapen ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi khat zieh a shina ahing um bangin mi khat zieh main mishi thawkiana zong ahing umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Adam a mi zousie ashi mabangin, Khrist ah mi zousie suhhingin a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh michin amauh hunchiet ah, Khrist khu ga masapen ahi a, tuazou chienga, A hing pei kiana ah, Khrist ate athou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuazou chiengin atawp atung dinga, tuahun chiengin, vaihawmna zousie, thuneina zousie leh silbawltheina zousie sumangin, Pa Pasian kungah leenggam khu apeta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aman amelmate zousie akeng nuoi a akoi masangsie vai ahawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Melma nukhia pen suhmanga um ding khu shina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Pasian in sil zousie akeng nuoi ah akoita hi.” Hinanleh “Sil zousie athu nuoi ah akoita hi achi chiengin athunuoi a sil zousie koipa ahuom kha sih,” chi akichien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh sil zousie athunuoi a aum chiengin, Tapa ngel zong, sil zousie athunuoi a koipa nuoi ah akitulutta dinga, Pasian khu bangkim a bangkim ahi theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi ahisihleh mishite a dinga baptisma atansah uh bang ding ata diei, mishite thoukia mawngmawng lou ahi u’leh? Bangdinga mishite baptisma atansah uh ahi diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh bang dinga eite zong naikal chin a shi zauhuoi a kikoi nuom ding ihi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesu Khrist i Mangpa a ka hing nei unaute aw, noute kisahtheipiin nitengin ka shi hi, chi ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Mihing deidan banga Ephesa khuo a gamsate kisuolpi ka hi leh kei dingin bang aphatuom diei?” Mishite thoukia lou ahi leh: Ne in dawn lei asih diei, zing chienga shi ding ihi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Sol in um sih un, lawm gilou in umdan hoi asusie hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Dihtatna lam ah khanglou unlen, khiel sih un, aziehpen mi pawlkhat in Pasian theina anei sih uhi, tampen na zumna ding ua ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Mikoi ahiei in mishite bangchi banga kaitho ahi ding uoi? Bangchibang tahsa neiin ahing thoukia ding uoi?” achi ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nang mi mo na haichi tu zong ashi phot sihleh a hing thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Na tu chiengin akung hing um ding pen na tu sih a Bu hiin, haichi dangdang hitaleh atang ahi na tu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in hoi asah bang chietin akung apie hi, haichi chinteng kungah ama kung ape chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tahsa zousie tahsa kibang ahi sih a, hinanleh mihingten tahsa chi tuom khat anei ua, gamsate tahsa atuom a, ngate tahsa atuom a, tualeh vate tahsa atuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Vanlam tahsa aum a, leilam tahsa zong a um hi, hinanleh vanlam tahsa thupina atuom a, leilam tahsa thupina atuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Niin thupina tuom khat anei a, hapi in thupina tuom anei hi, aasiten zong thupina tuom akinei ua, aasi khat leh aasi khat zong athupidan akibang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuamabangin mishi thawkiana zong ahi. Muottheia tuin a uma, muotthei loua kaithaw in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Simmaw huoitah a tuin a um a, thupitah a kaithaw in a um hi, hatloutah a tuin a um a, silbawltheitah a kaithawin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tahsalam sapum a tuin a um a, Hagau lam tahsa pum nei a kaithouin a um hi. Tahsalam sapum a uma Hagaulam sapum zong a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n “Mi masa Adam pen hinna nei mihinga siem ahi,” chia gel ahi; Adam nukhia pen hinna pepa Hagau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ahivangin Hagau lam aum masa sih a, tahsa lam aum masa hi, tuami nuain Hagaulam ahing um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mihing masa khu leivui a siem leimi ahia, Mihing nina pen vana hing kipan Mangpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Leivui a siem mi khu leivui a kisiempa bang ahi ua, vanlam mite zong vana mi bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Lei a kisiem mel ipuoh bangun vanmi mel zong ipaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hinanleh unaute aw na kung uah tam thu ka gen ahi, tahsa leh sisan in Pasian gam aluo thei sih a, muotthei in zong muottheilouna aluothei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ngai un, thuguh kiphuol ka hing hil ding hi; i unpi un i imu sieng sih ding ua, hinanleh i unpi un suhlamdangin i um sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Pengkul nukhia pen agin chiengin, thakhat in mitphiet kalin suhlamdangin i um ding uhi, aziehpen pengkul hing ging ding ahi; tua hun chiengin mishite muottheiloua kaithouin a um ding ua, eite zong suhlamdangin i umta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tam muot theiin muottheilouna asil dinga, tualeh tam shi theiin shitheilouna asil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tam muot theiin muottheilouna asil a, tam shi theiin shitheilouna asil hun chiengin, “Zawna in shina avalzouta,” chia kigiel khu ahing tangtungta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />“Aw shina na gu hei a um ahiei?” Aw hankhuh na guolzawna hei a um ata e?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Shina gu khu khelna ahi a, tualeh khelna thahatna khu dan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Hinanleh i Mangpa Jesu Khrist vanga eite guolzawna hing pepa Pasian kungah kipahthu um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka unau ittahte aw, dettah in suhling guollouin Mangpa nasep phatuom ngaitah in sem ngitnget un, na sepgimna uh Mangpa ah amawhna ahi sih, chi thei un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin misiengthoute dinga tuohkhawm thu ah, Galatia gam a hattuomte kunga thu ka pieh bangin nouten zong bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hing pei chienga tuohkhawm donna aum louna dingin hapta kaal khat a ni masapen in Pasian in ahing guolzawlna bangin mi chinin na kholkhawm masa chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hing pei chiengin koi hitaleh na muon penpen uh na silpieh uh va thah dingin na laihah u’toh Jerusalem ah ka sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei zong ka va pei alem leh, kei toh ka kizoh thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuin Masidonia gam ka tot suoh zou chiengin na kung uah ka hing pei ding hi. Masidonia gam tot suoh ka sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka khuolzinna ka peina tenga nouten nang hah kawi kawi theina dingun, bangtan ahiei phalbi sungteng na kung uah ka tam maithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu tungin ahileh ka khuolzin kawma noute hing mu malamka ut sih hi, hinanleh Mangpa’n pha asah leh, tomkhat na kung ua taam ta di ka kinem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Pentikos ni dong Ephesa khuo ah ka tam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kot lienpi leh nasepna phatuom tah kei a dingin akihonga, tualeh melma tampi zong a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuin Timothi na kung ua ahing pei leh, zau lou a na lah ua aum theina ding na ngaituo un, Ama zong kei bangbanga Mangpa nasem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin koiman simmaw sih heh, ka kung a ahing pei theina dingin lungmuong tahin hing ha zaw un, unaute toh ka kunga ang pei ka kinem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaupa Apollo tungtang thu ahileh, unaute toh na kung ua hing pei dingin ka dei mama hi, hinanleh tu tah a hing pei ding pen ama deidan ahi tadi sih hi, hinanleh hun lemtang anei chiengin ahing pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kiveng unlen ginna ah dingkip un, hangsan tahin um unlen, hat tahin um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na bawl zousie uh itna a bawl hi heh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Unaupa Stephenas innkuonpite, khu Akaia gam a Pasian thua ga masapen ahi ua, misiengthoute nasep pieh dingin akipumpieh uh chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tambang mite kungah leh michin koute toh semkhawm leh semgimte kunga kitulut dingin ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Stephenas, Fortunatus leh Akaikus ahing pei uh ka kipah hi, amauten na umlou kaal un ka tasap awng ahing huhpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaun ka hagau leh noute hagau ahalsah uhi, tuaziehin tambang mite theisiem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asia gam a hattuomten ahing nousiet uhi. Akuila leh Prisilla in a inn ua hattuom umte toh, Mangpa a lungtai tahin ahing nousiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Unaute zousiein noute ahing nousiet uhi. Kitawp siengthouin kinousiet tuo chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kei Paul in keima khut mama in tam nousietna kang giel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi koipou in Mangpa Jesu Khrist a it sih leh samsiet (Anathema) in um heh, Mangpa hing pei in (Maranatha).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist hepina na kung uah um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a ka hing itna na unpi ua kungah umta hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
